 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Being ill",
     "texto": [
      "**Болеть** (to be ill, to fall ill) takes the illness in the instrumental: **Я болею гриппом** («I have the flu»). With **простудиться** you say you caught a cold: **Я простудился** («I caught a cold», masculine).",
      "**Лечиться** (to be treated, to get treatment): **Я лечусь у врача** («I am being treated by the doctor»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Recovering",
     "texto": [
      "**Выздороветь** (to recover, perfective) and **выздоравливать** (to recover, imperfective): **Я выздоравливаю** («I am recovering»).",
      "**Выздоровел** is the past: **Он выздоровел** («He recovered»). You can say «выздоравливай!» (get well soon!)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
